Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.21,0:00:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位亲朋好友  今天大家齐聚一堂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends, family, we're gathered to celebrate here today...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.29,0:00:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,庆祝罗斯与艾蜜莉缔结良缘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the joyous union of Ross and Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  请跟我复述\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now Ross, repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.67,0:00:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.43,0:00:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,娶你  艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take thee, Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,娶你  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take thee, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要继续吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, shall I go on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.82,0:00:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说瑞秋  对不对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He said "Rachel", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要站过去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you think I should go up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  请继续\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Yes. Do go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.03,0:00:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们最好重来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think we'd better start again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  请你跟着我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.29,0:00:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,娶你  艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take thee, Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,娶你  艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take thee, Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:00:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则还会有谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. Like there'd be anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成为我的合法妻子  无论贫病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As my lawfully wedded wife, in sickness and in health...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.43,0:01:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至死不渝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...till death parts us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成为我的合法妻子  无论贫病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As my lawfully wedded wife, in sickness and in health...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.27,0:01:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至死不渝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...until death parts us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  我愿意  艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really, I do. Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请给我婚戒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have the rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉  为罗斯戴上戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emily, place this ring on Ross' finger...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,象征你永远爱他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...as a symbol of your bond everlasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  为艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, place this ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戴上戒指  代表\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...on Emily's hand as a symbol...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你俩白头偕老\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...of the love that encircles you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.89,0:01:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很乐意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.22,0:01:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯与艾蜜莉已经宣誓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross and Emily have made their declarations...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很荣幸宣布  他们结为夫妻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and it gives me great pleasure to declare them husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以亲吻新娘了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You may kiss the bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.11,0:02:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这比他娶同性恋那次更糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is worse than when he married the lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.91,0:02:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保持微笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just keep smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进行得真顺利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that went well. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没开枪杀死她就不错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It could've been worse. He could've shot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.18,0:02:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚真有点耍宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. That was pretty funny, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第01集  阴错阳差\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E01  The One After Ross Says Rachel
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.61,0:02:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:03:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你搞砸所有事情  简直是恶梦一场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You spoiled everything. It's like a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.03,0:03:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的亲朋好友都在场  我以后拿什么脸见人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All my friends and family are out there. How can I face them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么做得出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.86,0:03:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯和艾蜜莉  不管怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, no matter what happens with Ross and Emily...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都吃得到蛋糕吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we still get cake, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  亲爱的  你慢慢来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's all right. No, no. You take your time, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在外面等你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be out here. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要补妆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's just fixing her makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我恨你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你偏挑这个时候  说错名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boy, a bad time to say the wrong name, huh, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  谢了  老爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's true. Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家应该跳舞啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}People should be dancing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:03:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是婚宴  来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, this is a party. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.73,0:04:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  跳舞啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey. Dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂   华森室内设计\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, Waltham Interiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  我是罗斯盖勒的私人医生  费兰吉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, this is Ross Geller's personal physician, Dr. Phalange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现罗斯忘了吃药\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I discovered that Ross forgot to take his brain medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他这人不吃药\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, now, without it, uh, in the brain of Ross...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就有可能讲错女人的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...uh, women's names are interchangeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这完全不能怪他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Through no fault of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  是菲比你啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是菲比  是费兰吉医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, not Phoebe. Dr. Phalange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也错乱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. You have it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你别误会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, I hope you don't take this the wrong way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:05:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们今晚约了要见面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I know we had plans to meet up tonight and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我担心以后做不成朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh. I'm just kind of worried about what it might do to our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么这么不小心  还不小心了七次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh. How could we have let this happen? Seven times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.31,0:05:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  我们人在国外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, look. We were away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又是浪漫的异乡  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In a foreign, romantic country. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都怪伦敦不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I blame London.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坏伦敦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bad London.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So look, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然我们还在伦敦  就可以继续  对不对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...while we're still in London, I mean, we can keep doing it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们别无选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I don't see that we have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是一回家就不能做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But when we're back home, we don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Only here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到楼下有酒窖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I saw a wine cellar downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我两分钟后下去找你  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll meet you there in two minutes. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我有事情要问你  现在啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mon? Mon, I got to ask you something. Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.05,0:05:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯刚刚说出我的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross said my name up there. I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能假装没听到吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just can't pretend that didn't happen can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.93,0:05:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我该怎么办  做正确的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, what should I do? Just do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.52,0:06:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听天由命  努力争取  不要死心眼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tow the line. Thread the needle. Think outside the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  听着  我要问罗斯  他是什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, wait, listen. I'm gonna talk to Ross about what he thinks it meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  瑞秋  不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. Rachel, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's married.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Married.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你还不懂  我也没办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you don't realize that, I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  你帮不了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right. You can't help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克  这是我们的错吗  没把小孩教好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jack, is it all our fault? Were we bad parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没地方坐还叫人吃牛排\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh yeah? Well, who serves steak when there's no place to sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我们怎么吃嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, how are you supposed to eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.77,0:06:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好  怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪里了  不是约好了在酒窖碰面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where were you? We were supposed to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了  当我没说  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Forget it. That's off. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两分钟后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The next tour of the wine cellar...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为各位介绍酒窖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...will commence in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你搞什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你答应菲比  等她生完孩子才吃肉的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You promised Phoebe you wouldn't eat meat until she has the babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然我们在国外就不算\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I figured we're in another country, so it doesn't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.83,0:07:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那倒是  他说得对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's true. The man's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hi.
