Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见了  盖勒  等下  等下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Goodbye, Geller. Now, hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你女儿跟我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, look. Your daughter and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚预定去度蜜月\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...are supposed to leave tonight for our honeymoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你们转告她  我会去机场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, you tell her that I'm gonna be at that airport...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望她也会去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I hope that she'll be there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说成瑞秋的名字  但这只是无心之过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I said Rachel's name, but it didn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不过是我的朋友  就这样  请转告艾蜜莉我爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's just a friend. That's all. Now, look, just tell Emily I love her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想跟她共度余生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and that I can't imagine spending my life with anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.14,0:14:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请保证  你们一定会转告她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, promise me that you'll tell her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.98,0:14:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我会告诉她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'll tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  臭婆娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, bugger face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.61,0:14:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打电话给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也一天到晚的待在厕所\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You spend half your life in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么就不会从窗户滚蛋呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do you never go out the bloody window?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们不再上床才对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe it's best we never got to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:14:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则那晚就不会感觉特别了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it kind of makes that one night special.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理论上来讲  我们还在海外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, technically, we still are over international waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去洗手间  待会来找我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to the bathroom. Maybe I'll see you there in a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以问个问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我昨晚跟费丽西蒂  一起看《我的巨人》  我心想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Felicity and I, we were watching My Giant. And I was thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己永远不可能  演得跟那个巨人一样棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm never gonna be as good an actor as that giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我想当演员  是不是只是痴心妄想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you think I'm just wasting my life with this acting thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个巨人大概比我小五岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, the giant's like five years younger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有办法跟他一样优秀吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, you think I'll ever get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.31,0:15:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks, man. Okay, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他比我高好多啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But what about how much taller he is than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在已经不可能再长高了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, there's no way I can make myself taller now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以后科学怎么发展  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And who knows what science will come up with in the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我死时  只是一个身高平庸的小人物呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but, Chandler, what if I die an unsuccessful, regular-size man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.92,0:16:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你厕所上了半个小时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Monica. Wow, you've been in the bathroom for, like, a half-hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也吃了牛肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Had the beef tips, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你吃过肉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You ate meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟人嘿咻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You had sex!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们才没有   我知道你没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, we didn't. I know you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.87,0:16:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的是摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was talking about Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我才没跟人嘿咻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, I did not have sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怀孕害的我灵感不准\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, this pregnancy is throwing me all off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去跟小鸡小鸭打招呼  我跟你去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna say hi to the chick and duck. Oh, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你何必去  你不是四天都去喂他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would you need to say hi? You've been feeding them for four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:17:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我回家好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, right. Maybe I'll just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.03,0:17:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只剩下我们两个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, we certainly are alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.65,0:17:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我们说好回纽约就不做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes! Good thing we have that "not New York" rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然你说到这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, listen, since we're on that subject...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.16,0:17:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...um, I just wanted to tell you that, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.91,0:17:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时我在伦敦心情很不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I was going through a really hard time in London...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为哥哥结婚  别人还把我认作他妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...what with my brother getting married and that guy thinking I was Ross' mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总而言之\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, anyway, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那晚对我来说意义非凡  我的意思是  我要谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That night meant a lot to me. And I guess I'm trying to say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.60,0:17:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我那天也不是随便上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, that night meant a lot to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并不是因为我心情不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it wasn't because I was in a bad place or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很重视那晚是因为  你很性感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It just meant a lot to me because you're really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:18:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样说可以吗  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that okay? Ha, ha. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我也很帅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm cute too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你也很帅  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you're cute too. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去整理行李了  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I got to go unpack. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我时差还没调回来  这表示我还在伦敦吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm still on London time. Does that count?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that counts. Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（航厦及出境航班）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.57,0:18:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在等候补机位回纽约\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I've been on standby for a flight home for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还没等到艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Oh. So no sign of Emily, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是几点的飞机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What time are you supposed to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次呼叫  前往雅典的1066班机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is the last call for Flight 1066 to Athens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次呼叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The last call.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就快了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pretty soon, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.65,0:19:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白她怎么可以这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just... I don't understand. I mean, how could she do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是白痴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What, am I like a complete idiot...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.36,0:19:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然以为她会来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...for thinking she'd actually show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.58,0:19:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.03,0:19:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是白痴   罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not an idiot, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.37,0:19:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是爱得无可救药\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're a guy very much in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.21,0:19:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那还不是一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Same difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搭乘1066班机  前往雅典的旅客请登机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All passengers for Flight 1066 to Athens should now be onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没戏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你知道什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.31,0:19:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  对  我认为你应该\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Yeah, I do think you should go...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己去  到遥远的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...by yourself. Get some distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想个清楚  这对你一定有好处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Clear your head. I think it would be really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.65,0:20:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.61,0:20:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你应该要去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on, Ross. I think it would be really good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我应该去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could. I could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.49,0:20:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她实在太扯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't even believe her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.25,0:20:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我决定去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? I am going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.42,0:20:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  为什么不呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.67,0:20:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不对  没错  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right? Right. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  我们纽约见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks. Okay, I'll see you back at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望我搭得上飞机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I ever get a flight out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了  怎么了  等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. What? Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不如你也一起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.93,0:20:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我有两张机票\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I have two tickets. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不太好吧  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I don't know, Ross. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  一定很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah. It'd be great. I mean, you can...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以躺在海滩上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can lay on the beach...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.32,0:20:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以哭诉婚姻失败\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I can cry over my failed marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看我多幽默啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You see how I make jokes? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要有朋友陪我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, I could use a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  也行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wow. Okay, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以陪你去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cool. All right, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这就走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, we're going to Greece. Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了拿外套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aah, aah. I forgot my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫他们等下  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you tell them to wait. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. Wait. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emily!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要梅洛红酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, yes. I will have a glass of the Merlot...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.67,0:21:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位要气泡白酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and he will have a white-wine spritzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看  机场在动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, look at that. The airport's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞机在动吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, are we moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞机在动吗  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are we moving? Why are we moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:21:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.73,0:22:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,机长知道飞机在动吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, does the captain know that we're moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.53,0:22:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  老天爷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my gosh.
